@startuml
title Alarm Clock State Machine

[*] --> OffState

state "Off" as OffState
OffState : entry/Initialize
OffState : do/Wait for user input
OffState : exit/Terminate

state "AlarmSet" as AlarmSet
AlarmSet : entry/Set alarm time
AlarmSet : do/Wait for current time to match set time
AlarmSet : exit/Stop ringing

state "Ringing" as Ringing
Ringing : entry/Ring the alarm
Ringing : do/Play alarm sound
Ringing : exit/Terminate ringing

OffState --> AlarmSet : Set alarm
AlarmSet --> Ringing : Current time matches set time
Ringing --> OffState : Stop alarm

@enduml
